(7390411, 1161538, 180696, '<td valign="top">Just a pity about the washed-out skies. A little more DOF would''ve skewed the white sky out a little. I realise that it is a minimal challenge, but sometimes one can be too hast in trying to find the right choice of subject to enter.</td>', 'Just a pity about the washed-out skies. A little more DOF would''ve skewed the white sky out a little. I realise that it is a minimal challenge, but sometimes one can be too hast in trying to find the right choice of subject to enter.', '2015-07-21 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390412, 1160815, 180696, '<td valign="top">Definitely a quirky image, like it.</td>', 'Definitely a quirky image, like it.', '2015-07-21 13:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390413, 1161486, 69368, '<td valign="top">what a fantastic idea! The winner, for sure!</td>', 'what a fantastic idea! The winner, for sure!', '2015-07-21 13:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390414, 1161323, 180696, '<td valign="top">A lovely image, just a pity that you cropped the image a little too tight on the right</td>', 'A lovely image, just a pity that you cropped the image a little too tight on the right', '2015-07-21 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390417, 1161542, 180696, '<td valign="top">A lovely idea and nicely captured. I just find that the whites are very washed out and makes the image seem blurry and distracting on the bottom of the image. I think you could have gotten away with your idea still, even after perhaps cropping it in a little to get rid of the very white areas. Furthermore, I love your image and the title that accompanies it! :)</td>', 'A lovely idea and nicely captured. I just find that the whites are very washed out and makes the image seem blurry and distracting on the bottom of the image. I think you could have gotten away with your idea still, even after perhaps cropping it in a little to get rid of the very white areas. Furthermore, I love your image and the title that accompanies it! :)', '2015-07-21 14:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390418, 1161449, 180696, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image! The black and whites are very well balanced :)</td>', 'Wonderful image! The black and whites are very well balanced :)', '2015-07-21 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390419, 1161164, 180696, '<td valign="top">Lovely leading lines and crop! Great idea and nice sharp image</td>', 'Lovely leading lines and crop! Great idea and nice sharp image', '2015-07-21 14:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390421, 1160728, 180696, '<td valign="top">You captured the moment while the skies were at it''s best! Great Image</td>', 'You captured the moment while the skies were at it''s best! Great Image', '2015-07-21 14:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390422, 1161324, 180696, '<td valign="top">Great image and crooked alright. Always a pity that one cannot change the whether. The sky is just too white, pity that this is a minimal challenge.</td>', 'Great image and crooked alright. Always a pity that one cannot change the whether. The sky is just too white, pity that this is a minimal challenge.', '2015-07-21 14:08:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390424, 1161252, 180696, '<td valign="top">I love the way the crooked branch frames in the bird. I just feel that there is a lot of the image that could''ve been cropped out to get an even closer image of the bird with the crooked branch still in it. The bird in the image as a whole, is a little lost. The twig peeking in on the top of the image is a little distracting and could''ve been cropped out as I mentioned.</td>', 'I love the way the crooked branch frames in the bird. I just feel that there is a lot of the image that could''ve been cropped out to get an even closer image of the bird with the crooked branch still in it. The bird in the image as a whole, is a little lost. The twig peeking in on the top of the image is a little distracting and could''ve been cropped out as I mentioned.', '2015-07-21 14:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390425, 1161316, 180696, '<td valign="top">What can I say, I think that your image tells a lovey story.</td>', 'What can I say, I think that your image tells a lovey story.', '2015-07-21 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390427, 1160727, 180696, '<td valign="top">Yip, it is a crooked tree, but there isn''t much creativity and craftsmanship put into taking this photo. One still has to try and utilise as much camera skills as possible.</td>', 'Yip, it is a crooked tree, but there isn''t much creativity and craftsmanship put into taking this photo. One still has to try and utilise as much camera skills as possible.', '2015-07-21 14:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390428, 1161470, 180696, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s crooked, but not a very sharp image.</td>', 'Yes, it''s crooked, but not a very sharp image.', '2015-07-21 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390430, 1160747, 180696, '<td valign="top">Lovely diagonal lines</td>', 'Lovely diagonal lines', '2015-07-21 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390434, 1161292, 180696, '<td valign="top">The theme is spot on I would say, but... one still has to attempt to use some camera skills and obvious general knowledge. Firstly I feel that the image was taken at the wrong time of the day. Secondly the background is very busy and distracting. If you look at the white headstones, they are totally washed out and exceptionally bright. There are ways to work "in camera" to rid some of these issues.</td>', 'The theme is spot on I would say, but... one still has to attempt to use some camera skills and obvious general knowledge. Firstly I feel that the image was taken at the wrong time of the day. Secondly the background is very busy and distracting. If you look at the white headstones, they are totally washed out and exceptionally bright. There are ways to work "in camera" to rid some of these issues.', '2015-07-21 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7390435, 1160256, 180696, '<td valign="top">A pity that the caterpillar is just about to crawl out of the frame... The composition could have been improved and still have being able to crookedness of the scene.</td>', 'A pity that the caterpillar is just about to crawl out of the frame... The composition could have been improved and still have being able to crookedness of the scene.', '2015-07-21 14:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
