(7392829, 1161123, 177322, '<td valign="top">Thought I recognized the Centennial Bridge!  :-)<br/> <br/>I agree with the other commenter, some curves, mid-tone, and shadows work would have improved this.  Yet, in my opinion, it was a great take on the challenge.</td>', 'Thought I recognized the Centennial Bridge!  :-) I agree with the other commenter, some curves, mid-tone, and shadows work would have improved this.  Yet, in my opinion, it was a great take on the challenge.', '2015-07-27 17:33:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7392838, 1161494, 122678, '<td valign="top">The building is on the West Side of Manhattan in Chelsea, I believe it is the IAC headquarter building. Originally, photographed in the morning, it was blue, I went back to shoot in the late afternoon only to find it is white with a blue stripe as the glass is very reflective in its angles and the lighting. Beautiful building and definitly "Crooked" in its shape.<br/>I can see where it might resemble a ship after the comment below but i could not find any info confirming that in the article I read about the building and the architect Frank Gehry.<br/>I appreciate the comments and kind words along with my score.<br/> <br/></td>', 'The building is on the West Side of Manhattan in Chelsea, I believe it is the IAC headquarter building. Originally, photographed in the morning, it was blue, I went back to shoot in the late afternoon only to find it is white with a blue stripe as the glass is very reflective in its angles and the lighting. Beautiful building and definitly "Crooked" in its shape.I can see where it might resemble a ship after the comment below but i could not find any info confirming that in the article I read about the building and the architect Frank Gehry.I appreciate the comments and kind words along with my score. ', '2015-07-27 18:06:44.000000', NULL, 0),
